Well, hello, to everyone here on rgrn. I'm new to here, but I'm used to
hang around on #nethack on freenode. I just had my best game ever with
a huge YASD, so I decided posting.

Human Lawful Female Valk. I started out going down, skipping the mines
and finding a coaligned altar on dlvl 4. I sacced for Mjollnir. After
getting it I went all the way to Minetown.

Not enough candles, and no magic lamps in the lighting store, kinda bad
luck... I was planning on price-ID'ing some scrolls but there was no
general store or second hand book store. So I went back up, going down
to find some clear water. Got 2 uncursed potions - I blessed them on
the same altar I got Mjollnir. I uncursed an elven mithril coat I
found.

I rushed down to soko and got a bag of holding. Went back, up to the
mines all the way to the mines end. I got a touchstone - uncursed. I
got some gems too. I went back.

Down again, pretty straith-forward. No Bigroom, and I wasn't ready for
the Quest. I found a graveyard around dlvl19, and got a good portion of
wraiths. :)

I went down more and found Medusa. I died here. I'll explain how -
Pretty YASD!
I got Medusa-2. The one with the room at the left. I hate that one.
Also, it was a huge mistake to do Medusa as my AC was 0. I was able to
kill some things, but I got to 3 hp once so I prayed. Went further
freezing water with a /oCold and avoiding ;. I jumped in water once so
my armor was rusty etc. I was next to one of the rooms when my /oCold
was empty...

I had ~10 HP at the moment. I took my pickaxe and dug in the room. No
water flowed to that space somehow, and man, I was happy. I moved in
the space and BOOM. There was a leocrotta right next to me. The
leocrotta hits! You die.. --More--

Anyway, It was an ok game. Best ever, for me.

HappyFoppy, neutral female human Valkyrie


